  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.815714,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Having engaged a sleeping-berth I naturally hurried, coin in hand, to the conductor, as all wise travellers do (usually to their discomfiture) to see if I could be accommodated with a compartment to myself and be guaranteed against invasion.",
      "output_sha256": "56127f1cb874b392a1918045824249664541bb3942b0bc2e485becbc5dd9d43e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "56127f1cb874b392a1918045824249664541bb3942b0bc2e485becbc5dd9d43e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I couldn't.",
      "output_sha256": "f6e11942b25639753d9cca6b08f1d9690bcb2d426c39f2e8813b135f465a5c02",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "f6e11942b25639753d9cca6b08f1d9690bcb2d426c39f2e8813b135f465a5c02",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I then sought my compartment, to learn the worst as to my position, whether above or below the necessarily offensive person who was to be my companion.",
      "output_sha256": "1fb74f4a90e6928897a9eba053ab0970f02e3bf647dfcb5f8a4d6224566e5d9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "1fb74f4a90e6928897a9eba053ab0970f02e3bf647dfcb5f8a4d6224566e5d9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He was already there, and we exchanged the hard implacable glare that is reserved among the English for the other fellow in a wagon-lit.",
      "output_sha256": "a8558a6aae7bf665d0efb2ade86362fb5da692d6ae70f7c6c0f109edd4a48422",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "a8558a6aae7bf665d0efb2ade86362fb5da692d6ae70f7c6c0f109edd4a48422",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It was a relief to discover that he had drawn the dreaded upper berth, which allowed me to ease up a bit.",
      "output_sha256": "f1524c8e0f639a95f3835c5cc1009bc146e6b894b57acd3fe6e0e62aad9d8552",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.323488,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3478bc94dac9644e34b44764645c4f873e6cecb83a99a89a536b00f2317c6798"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f1524c8e0f639a95f3835c5cc1009bc146e6b894b57acd3fe6e0e62aad9d8552",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Eventually, we engaged in polite exchanges—discussing the use of hat racks and storage areas, and making amicable agreements regarding the lighting, which I could control from my lower berth.",
      "output_sha256": "8bfb75f30cb68363217fd407165902d354a4783b5555b964a2f2f698d898f798",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.323488,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3478bc94dac9644e34b44764645c4f873e6cecb83a99a89a536b00f2317c6798"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8bfb75f30cb68363217fd407165902d354a4783b5555b964a2f2f698d898f798",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "By the time morning arrived, we had warmed to each other enough that he felt comfortable sharing his significant grievance about Paris.",
      "output_sha256": "e4eb0368a0d417ded201add3e64f71ccb1bb29e1f00902472d75fce35676d81e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.323488,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3478bc94dac9644e34b44764645c4f873e6cecb83a99a89a536b00f2317c6798"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e4eb0368a0d417ded201add3e64f71ccb1bb29e1f00902472d75fce35676d81e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This grievance, which he considered that every one should know about, bore upon the prevalence of spurious coins in the so-called Gay City and the tendency of Parisians to work them off on foreigners.",
      "output_sha256": "1e5646c8b0cf7b98468fa7faf0041e3f804eee9b7df96b4c3eb92f94a3cfe59c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e5646c8b0cf7b98468fa7faf0041e3f804eee9b7df96b4c3eb92f94a3cfe59c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "According to him, it was simply unimaginable that foreigners, particularly the English, should face such a lack of hospitality.",
      "output_sha256": "c7bc23e51c22b37980c8c2d7331026a96cbbbb0c87383c2f05abc7e8fb85ec71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.297583,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7,
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "01e38d23a4c7fa6b013917f76bd61fac88c4152656017ffba9b4a25b61672fe3",
        "2a481658cee0d24dacb85b505042db6ee47b7d7aed7458f3b548791cc7e1d142"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c7bc23e51c22b37980c8c2d7331026a96cbbbb0c87383c2f05abc7e8fb85ec71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet it was the English who often fell prey to those holding outdated francs, five-franc pieces lacking their rightful silver, and ten-franc coins devoid of gold.",
      "output_sha256": "ad317b07ca2723bc9d168c70d7efc4abbe76ea1ea16d0a5397cae664b2511ca5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.398636,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5c2fc4fb057068a61f0f0ab05e53811b2ebcad7704fbe740dceaaeb60de2bc3e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ad317b07ca2723bc9d168c70d7efc4abbe76ea1ea16d0a5397cae664b2511ca5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He had been in Paris but an hour or so when—but let me tell the story as my travelling companion told it to me.",
      "output_sha256": "0f5cb896dfd600d55620151f114b084d2ad1a47225c789ab773f7b33eb74c2be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f5cb896dfd600d55620151f114b084d2ad1a47225c789ab773f7b33eb74c2be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"I don't know what your experience in Paris has been,\" he said, \"but I have been victimised right and left.\"",
      "output_sha256": "c53cf9d32b2aa7cad081e38dc7c1ae88cb486047babf6d08440d93a9e08e7e93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "c53cf9d32b2aa7cad081e38dc7c1ae88cb486047babf6d08440d93a9e08e7e93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He was now getting up, while I lay at comparative ease in my berth and watched his difficulties in the congested room and disliked his under vest.",
      "output_sha256": "019afa67cd343847d71274ca69d1a81eb28fb6e3d247944a99e0c5ab3f4828f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "019afa67cd343847d71274ca69d1a81eb28fb6e3d247944a99e0c5ab3f4828f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"I had been in Paris but a few hours,\" he continued, \"when it was necessary to pay a cabman.",
      "output_sha256": "e66145dc62fb0e575cf3d5b6f1c0cb4d2291e91ebc61b6be065c4ad5b084433e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "e66145dc62fb0e575cf3d5b6f1c0cb4d2291e91ebc61b6be065c4ad5b084433e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I handed him a franc.",
      "output_sha256": "5c68805b49ac1b07ade191bd76a94b1ffb2ba87f666119f7574267c12f77ddd7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c68805b49ac1b07ade191bd76a94b1ffb2ba87f666119f7574267c12f77ddd7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He examined it, laughed and returned it.",
      "output_sha256": "e37b557a23d732cf008b5ea23249b824580512581ab6f255462cf0b79e651b6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "e37b557a23d732cf008b5ea23249b824580512581ab6f255462cf0b79e651b6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I tried again with another coin, only to receive the same response.",
      "output_sha256": "60407de6624db04755e5a7c0affeeb7dfce241e8e1ea703beffe0a5ffcca8ff7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.376457,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0d9cf852401d459325deefb2a2c00ccca18a8b6b9f4ba01429786c4dacf05825",
        "5d894b8d12c2f7938f32a20e376b8ce9350a493ab55a651df0424249299b2ae1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "60407de6624db04755e5a7c0affeeb7dfce241e8e1ea703beffe0a5ffcca8ff7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Having found some good money to get rid of him, I sat down outside a café to try and remember where I had received the change in which these useless coins had been inserted.",
      "output_sha256": "1fd770c8815272f8eaba98a6c216450fd1efd46d72578b4ab8dcea4c370e9024",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "1fd770c8815272f8eaba98a6c216450fd1efd46d72578b4ab8dcea4c370e9024",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "During a week in Paris much of my time was spent in that way.\"",
      "output_sha256": "13e2d85630ddcd3b3630390deaefff2dd09fc5bf5b3d70f657550dbedd805ec4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "13e2d85630ddcd3b3630390deaefff2dd09fc5bf5b3d70f657550dbedd805ec4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He sighed and drew on his trousers.",
      "output_sha256": "f3567abfafceeb82bf7d97e450ab3bbf3560c24f1f328f0328caa0a29c743546",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "f3567abfafceeb82bf7d97e450ab3bbf3560c24f1f328f0328caa0a29c743546",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "His braces were red.",
      "output_sha256": "8ec0514e1fb445a880a060bbfefb6a71455b0294cf15353b054ab572716a6736",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "8ec0514e1fb445a880a060bbfefb6a71455b0294cf15353b054ab572716a6736",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I showed some of the bad francs to a waiter,” he recounted.",
      "output_sha256": "660d3afbf1b569954cafe2fa4bcd3deaef1dd5201d27b42f77222371f614c715",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.598371,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ac5d2dd897984187424e0c53280eb2ed807632fd695f0c439a481f6e836e3ff5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "660d3afbf1b569954cafe2fa4bcd3deaef1dd5201d27b42f77222371f614c715",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“He reacted just like the cab driver—he laughed.",
      "output_sha256": "6d7efc50670656b4f9152eb6a3e7fb1ec3336c8dcc9cc93fbb40de3361587232",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.598371,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ac5d2dd897984187424e0c53280eb2ed807632fd695f0c439a481f6e836e3ff5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6d7efc50670656b4f9152eb6a3e7fb1ec3336c8dcc9cc93fbb40de3361587232",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In fact, few things provoke Parisian amusement quite like a counterfeit coin.",
      "output_sha256": "e155f708c521d109d5d74ff3a36a41651a67e7225a90e4493af3d07286a85774",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.421098,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "61cc7ecb37a2e7d4d76eb13297195e7a6d02e2266e58ff7f445c3c1cfd1d63f0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e155f708c521d109d5d74ff3a36a41651a67e7225a90e4493af3d07286a85774",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Everyone I showed my collection to found it hilarious.”",
      "output_sha256": "99759e10b6880a0ffbe164707eb4361af77d8be4aa6d629deb9b14896684e65a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.347045,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0ecfad71bf7d107576ae10a24dd516d824ca98cc2c4cd9266eb8a83aed7b7af1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "99759e10b6880a0ffbe164707eb4361af77d8be4aa6d629deb9b14896684e65a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "His face blackened with rage.",
      "output_sha256": "825cfcbc95321d5c85d49094732711707e1a0d0c548003b89ba3ccdbece4e394",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "825cfcbc95321d5c85d49094732711707e1a0d0c548003b89ba3ccdbece4e394",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"This cheerful callousness in a matter involving a total want of principle and straight-dealing as between man and man,\" he said, \"denotes to what a point of cynicism the Parisians have attained.\"",
      "output_sha256": "728c50fc60586f9603f44fa273630828c236d72422b5587ac711966dcbdaaf38",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "728c50fc60586f9603f44fa273630828c236d72422b5587ac711966dcbdaaf38",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I agreed with him.",
      "output_sha256": "4965cbabdac228783815a9c58f166c7f329e45f944b58ed79a03fb59bd4cc0b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "4965cbabdac228783815a9c58f166c7f329e45f944b58ed79a03fb59bd4cc0b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"The waiter,\" he continued, \"went through my money and pointed out what was good and what either bad or out of currency.",
      "output_sha256": "d2eb3a7653e4d72076a47bd77596016c54adacebd789551b43df1289198144e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2eb3a7653e4d72076a47bd77596016c54adacebd789551b43df1289198144e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He called other waiters to enjoy the joke.",
      "output_sha256": "b0658c339fa571938d24397cb2c27d3eb70d3dc64a78e9cfe74cecab4d917aa7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "b0658c339fa571938d24397cb2c27d3eb70d3dc64a78e9cfe74cecab4d917aa7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It seemed that in about four hours I had acquired three bad francs, one bad two-franc piece and two bad five-franc pieces.",
      "output_sha256": "5c98a2833f42c33117a84a6b82f68e78a102869e1c161bb9cfd97085bf682608",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c98a2833f42c33117a84a6b82f68e78a102869e1c161bb9cfd97085bf682608",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I put them away in another pocket and got fresh change from him, which, as I subsequently discovered, contained one obsolete five-franc piece and two discredited francs.",
      "output_sha256": "aa9283c02c786d51ca13fbf52265a68e11c5a57792fce44a22dcbad05c86d42e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa9283c02c786d51ca13fbf52265a68e11c5a57792fce44a22dcbad05c86d42e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The cycle continued, and I became a perpetual target.”",
      "output_sha256": "90b9f434c1e9c9a8efdb218cdc580464b3f681a9558f4bcf24ced04ddace9bdd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.364286,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32,
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3d7d600117a8821f9fa873d0d7dd989bfbca77e0be88eff5a1bd724ed0587435",
        "b1d1425626acf042f769d8bac6e316ad1e11ea62572aa98f95fe09c027e262e3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "90b9f434c1e9c9a8efdb218cdc580464b3f681a9558f4bcf24ced04ddace9bdd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At this point, he began to wash up, interrupting the flow of his narrative.",
      "output_sha256": "b5bef32293436fecb71ecb96b7d40115cf5dddd653c6db523ca8321977c935e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.390357,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1332f7129ab1db1312fea3f8fd28dbc3a7cf95fb522ce7cff8defceed677d9c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b5bef32293436fecb71ecb96b7d40115cf5dddd653c6db523ca8321977c935e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When he re-emerged I asked him why he didn't always examine his change.",
      "output_sha256": "9f799e18347b962ad0a6c2266d5fa98e4c04982fc021b11e4c38c15c391d79c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f799e18347b962ad0a6c2266d5fa98e4c04982fc021b11e4c38c15c391d79c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"It's very difficult to remember to do so,\" he said, \"and, besides, I am not an expert.",
      "output_sha256": "5248e6768366f5606d3e6f07dae13da8cc68447d773b694bfed84501502a0aa5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "5248e6768366f5606d3e6f07dae13da8cc68447d773b694bfed84501502a0aa5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Things only got worse, and when I received a counterfeit gold piece, I realized I had to take action.",
      "output_sha256": "411a1be512855001d1a5f7c2e0a4f7ff7b8652ccb73b856447e50dc2a13cfa64",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.572769,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fac90bb18a1e35eb8b544d1db4410ab104ff862b76a43ad417b4c5ff69ef567b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "411a1be512855001d1a5f7c2e0a4f7ff7b8652ccb73b856447e50dc2a13cfa64",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "So I wrote to the Chief of Police.”",
      "output_sha256": "b8420d50a233383a31c95475ce30a35729361926341bee7d9d7e668a694dc578",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.572769,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fac90bb18a1e35eb8b544d1db4410ab104ff862b76a43ad417b4c5ff69ef567b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b8420d50a233383a31c95475ce30a35729361926341bee7d9d7e668a694dc578",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36,
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"In French?\"",
      "output_sha256": "6119478f879c4f99a45b9e16c2f90a9935f0f87c38a5d6e61b275daca8c9e2d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "6119478f879c4f99a45b9e16c2f90a9935f0f87c38a5d6e61b275daca8c9e2d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I asked.",
      "output_sha256": "74426a9ec1446f69dc8ada33951545c8421b8f4c8715a1a0e643d20c0d5ff9fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "74426a9ec1446f69dc8ada33951545c8421b8f4c8715a1a0e643d20c0d5ff9fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“No, in English—the language of integrity.",
      "output_sha256": "a3fe0fab9e6fcf05bd89e8276888508d886bc38103ac50542b6fe9d0485cf2c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.815714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a1b8e2ad631e7381c45c539212149896df7f43a4cd8e9dda3664ebec9253a9de"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a3fe0fab9e6fcf05bd89e8276888508d886bc38103ac50542b6fe9d0485cf2c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I told him my own experiences.",
      "output_sha256": "f38eee19d39a2ada91a8f6470b93e64d952a7b1d195ade44bce4043b2b954635",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "f38eee19d39a2ada91a8f6470b93e64d952a7b1d195ade44bce4043b2b954635",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I said that other English people whom I had met had testified to similar trouble; and I put it to him that as a matter of civic pride— esprit de pays —he should do his utmost to cleanse Paris of this evil.",
      "output_sha256": "43ba39059bee89791ebc1f43e22ee70b683603f29203552e7261cbdd00793ca4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "43ba39059bee89791ebc1f43e22ee70b683603f29203552e7261cbdd00793ca4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I added that in my opinion the waiters were the worst offenders.\"",
      "output_sha256": "4e4666852e4a5853223f4c925cfaf927d2b9d65f193c2deb717368e9ebe915c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "4e4666852e4a5853223f4c925cfaf927d2b9d65f193c2deb717368e9ebe915c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Did you receive a response?”",
      "output_sha256": "3b70f894afff9eaa69d57b8ab9ff5910fd61f4a77279f3ba2b923e2e8e33b57d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.38,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cea17255ae9b54daeebef824b70ab6e843debad346aa034326288993afcb0709"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3b70f894afff9eaa69d57b8ab9ff5910fd61f4a77279f3ba2b923e2e8e33b57d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I asked.",
      "output_sha256": "74426a9ec1446f69dc8ada33951545c8421b8f4c8715a1a0e643d20c0d5ff9fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "74426a9ec1446f69dc8ada33951545c8421b8f4c8715a1a0e643d20c0d5ff9fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Not yet,\" he said, and having completed his toilet he made room for me.",
      "output_sha256": "4b4fb115a457cfc69f0623e9826aef140703ec4dc27d766577ecb9de6e17a3d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "4b4fb115a457cfc69f0623e9826aef140703ec4dc27d766577ecb9de6e17a3d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Later, meeting him in the restaurant-car, I asked him to show me his store of bad money.",
      "output_sha256": "a424b34f40c5af1e2f0b1ac789f5c4be5831a2cae3733ca88f4de7067755c598",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "a424b34f40c5af1e2f0b1ac789f5c4be5831a2cae3733ca88f4de7067755c598",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I wanted to see for myself what these coins were like.",
      "output_sha256": "58f81addbceb099f5d1a49efae45c981ca02ab0e66cdb419d50de145d4fde1e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "58f81addbceb099f5d1a49efae45c981ca02ab0e66cdb419d50de145d4fde1e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“I don’t have them any longer,” he replied.",
      "output_sha256": "9435402fccd12186d298e2d617a755b8f5c97153c21764c9ef70e6fb990d4a20",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.367857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "18bede3c96c532b745d5d023076d978b2a5586e877ddd1ae1624640cc44206c5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9435402fccd12186d298e2d617a755b8f5c97153c21764c9ef70e6fb990d4a20",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"You sent them to the Chief of the Police with your letter, I suppose?\"",
      "output_sha256": "f463fcad390e242ae18e418a2dd907d1f3da070f41b0551a7177eb112692535a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "f463fcad390e242ae18e418a2dd907d1f3da070f41b0551a7177eb112692535a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I said.",
      "output_sha256": "5d12427b09a1890aabff9ccb044a44c086e5a7b0395b95f99fac5a662a701ad3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "5d12427b09a1890aabff9ccb044a44c086e5a7b0395b95f99fac5a662a701ad3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“No, actually, I didn’t,” he admitted.",
      "output_sha256": "41b017fa631b5ce0d7ee5c344a1c7226a9269be1f635c236c9a9bfbfb13d22de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.512121,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d81b23d95c7600e876a14a96a282b21263f0b6aea3c9f1c91706a5ff20b6aef7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "41b017fa631b5ce0d7ee5c344a1c7226a9269be1f635c236c9a9bfbfb13d22de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"The fact is—well—as a matter of fact I managed to work them all off again.\"",
      "output_sha256": "c113dfb284ae0c60311fb7ce09be1c2124050b90d735f4292539a4e43b1e9878",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
